  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "“Erection of a glass conservatory extension”",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed extension, by reason of its additional size, scale, and depth on the boundary,&amp;nbsp; would result in an overly large and disproportionate extension when combined with the existing 6m deep extension. It would fail to be subservient to the original dwelling and would be out of character with the original design and the wider terrace, which it forms part of.&amp;nbsp; As such, the proposal fails to comply with policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character),&amp;nbsp; and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020) and policies D3 (&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;Optimising capacity through the design-led approach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;), and D4 (Delivering good design)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;of the London Plan (2021) and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
